OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with overnight rain
OL,6,Fclearing just after dawn. Blustery,
OL,7,Fand at times heavy, showers follow
OL,8,Fwith a risk of hail and thunder.
OL,9,FMilder but tempered by the fresh winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy but dry start to the
OL,12,Fevening ahead of a band of rain and
OL,13,Fshowers arriving from the west by the
OL,14,Fmorning. Fresh winds continue
OL,15,Fovernight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FChangeable, with periods of
OL,18,Fsunshine and showers, some of which
OL,19,Fmaybe heavy with hail and thunder.
OL,20,FWinds ease but gusty beneath showers
OL,21,Fand breezy along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
