OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDrier
OL,6,Fand brighter on Thursday after early
OL,7,Fshowers. Largely dry Friday and
OL,8,FSaturday with coastal showers in the
OL,9,Fsouth and fog patches forming
OL,10,Fovernight under clearing skies.
OL,11,FTemperatures around normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
